        "text": "<thinking> The task requires creating multiple Python files for a realistic direct embeddings API task set. The files need to be implemented using Google's services. The files are categorized into same-scenario scored files, local helper files, and later-step scored files. Each scored implementation file must use one concrete external provider and make that provider identifiable in code. The local helper files may contain configuration loading, payload normalization, or response parsing utilities when useful. </thinking>\n",
